    "detailed_description": "<strong>Story</strong><br>A child lays awake in the light of the moon, unaware the Halloween curse will be starting soon. The radio crackles to life, a mysterious girl who insists on guiding you through the nights. To hopefully survive the horror that is Boogeyman\u2026 and friends.<br><br><strong>Gameplay</strong><br>Navigate a haunting bedroom to survive each nightmarish encounter. Utilise strategic defence, resource management, and cunning tactics to survive each night. <br><br>Can you survive the relentless pursuit of the Boogeyman until morning light?<br><br>\u2022 Use your flashlight and water pistol to fight back against the Boogeyman's terror.<br><br>\u2022 Watch your beloved toys turn against you as they come to life.<br><br>\u2022 Learn the distractions that try to deceive you from the real threats.<br><br>\u2022 Weather will change each night, making it more difficult to hear or see the threats around you.<br><br>\u2022 Lights will go out one by one, making areas of the room near pitch black.<br><br>\u2022 Use pocket money to buy new items each night, such as UV glow sticks to slow the Boogeyman and his accomplices down.<br><br><strong>Face your fears head-on and immerse yourself in a nightmare you won't soon forget.</strong>",
